# GitHub Linguist maps the .mpl extension to "JetBrains MPS". Metabolian's .mpl
# files are our own Metabolic Pathway Language layout DSL — data emitted by
# tools/ingest, ~4.8 MB across 3,300+ files — and were showing as 86% of the
# repo's language bar. Reclassify them and keep them out of the language
# statistics so the bar reflects the actual TypeScript/JavaScript code.
*.mpl linguist-language=Text
*.mpl linguist-detectable=false
